{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"rg -n 'deployment|retained|stdo-work' /Users/jim/.codex/memories/MEMORY.md\"","aggregated_output":"25:- At the observed checkout, T-158 had deterministic/hello-world validation but fresh live `data_mapper` proof pending; T-163 had live scenario proof but validation pending; T-131 was the guided `odd_chat` live-build lane. The Python ambiguity register reported missing `deployment_contract` and `runtime_observation_contract`. [Task 1]\n55:- “Memory is an artifact of prior computation whose retained differences modify the space of subsequent transformations.” “Data is the distinguishable residue of prior computation, embodied in a form that can condition subsequent computation.” [Task 1]\n77:- GTL, ABG, STDO, formal model, candidate-only projection, qualified view, continuation-sensitive preservation, complete presentation environment, retained terms, fixed-Γ, typed annotations\n82:- The case establishes fixed-Γ preservation and ordinary statefulness, not emergence. A resolver proof must quantify over the complete presentation environment, including retained terms and qualified references, not merely historical assets. [Task 1]\n459:# Task Group: ABIogenesis T-287 retained-installed consumer preparation and RC1 qualification boundary\n474:## Task 2: Repair retained-installed consumer/preparation and historical recovery, success\n482:- T287_REUSE_CONSUMER_REPAIR_04, retained-installed-consumer.mjs, prepare-retained-setup-binding.mjs, eventless View, read_only_unchanged, completeAbgEventResource, artifact_unreadable, qualification_declaration_selection_unbound, Result/J\n547:- `odd_manager` owns bounded admission/read models and operator presentation; ABIogenesis owns events, replay semantics, Run truth, and liveness. The slice supplies identity-first discovery, per-Run status, bounded event pages, and lazy call detail. Key seams: `build_tenants/react_vite/src/server/abg-event-carrier-service.mjs`, `retained-run-observation-service.mjs`, `src/contracts/abg-run-observation.ts`, browser ingress validation, and `runtime/tests/test_t046_current_run_observation.mjs`. [Task 1]\n602:- ABIogenesis, code review, last 2 days of work, uncommitted-work, git status --porcelain=v1, git log --since='2 days ago', file mtimes, qualification contraction, retained-transition reuse, cold-record decoder, public readback, native workspace execution, GTL, HoG, ABG, Event Calculus, T-287\n1127:- symptom: document counts, syntax/link checks, successful maps, copied-text percentage, or URI count are called proof -> cause: mechanical evidence was substituted for semantic conservation, foundational integration, or qualification -> fix: inspect changed semantic boundaries, permissions, conditions, negative results, authority, retained distinctions, and explicit conditional foundation/work-recovery contracts. [Task 2]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
