{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"for task_file in AGENTS.md fixture_product.json specification/REQUIREMENT.md design/DESIGN.md TASK.md TOOLING.md; do printf '\\\\n--- %s ---\\\\n' \\\"\"'$task_file\"; cat \"$task_file\"; done'","aggregated_output":"\n--- AGENTS.md ---\nGoverning Product: fixture_product.json. Read specification/REQUIREMENT.md, design/DESIGN.md, TASK.md and TOOLING.md. Use the installed STDO skill for this governed task. Preserve unrelated files.\n\n--- fixture_product.json ---\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"stdo://releases/v3.0.1-rc.1/standards/schemas/product-definition.schema.json\",\n  \"composition\": [],\n  \"constitution\": {\n    \"additional_authorities\": [\n      \"./specification/INTENT.md\",\n      \"./specification/PRODUCT.md\"\n    ],\n    \"agent_bootstrap\": {\n      \"entrypoint\": \"#/constitution/entrypoints/0\",\n      \"targets\": [\n        \"./AGENTS.md\",\n        \"./CLAUDE.md\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"entrypoints\": [\n      {\n        \"basis\": \"#/constitution/stdo/basis\",\n        \"uri\": \"standards/frames/bootstrap.md\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"basis\": \"#/constitution/stdo/basis\",\n        \"uri\": \"standards/SPEC_METHOD.md\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"basis\": \"#/constitution/stdo/basis\",\n        \"uri\": \"standards/REFERENCE_FRAME.md\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"stdo\": {\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"manifest_sha256\": \"60356364a412dbde8cffe68fe0eda4e2749b0162acce93495534eee13b223df8\",\n        \"uri\": \"stdo://releases/v3.0.1-rc.1/\"\n      },\n      \"selector\": \"stdo://channels/3.0.1\",\n      \"source\": {\n        \"repository\": \"https://github.com/foolishimp/specification_methodology.git\"\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"how\": {\n    \"build_tenants\": [\n      {\n        \"design\": [\n          \"./design/DESIGN.md\"\n        ],\n        \"id\": \"urn:stdo:product-definition:qualification-release-deployment:tenant\",\n        \"implementation\": [\n          \"./deploy-test/payload.txt\",\n          \"./deploy-test/manifest.json\",\n          \"./outputs/deployment.md\"\n        ],\n        \"root\": \"./outputs/\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"common\": [\n      \"./design/DESIGN.md\",\n      \"./.qualification/OWNER.json\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"kind\": \"stdo.product-definition\",\n  \"local_constitution\": {\n    \"axioms\": [],\n    \"disambiguations\": [],\n    \"overrides\": []\n  },\n  \"product\": {\n    \"bounded_context\": {\n      \"definition\": \"./specification/PRODUCT.md#product-boundary\",\n      \"id\": \"urn:stdo:product-definition:qualification-release-deployment:boundary\"\n    },\n    \"definition_id\": \"urn:stdo:product-definition:qualification-release-deployment\",\n    \"name\": \"Qualification release-deployment\",\n    \"source_project\": \"./\"\n  },\n  \"reference_frame_bases\": [\n    {\n      \"applies_to\": [\n        \"urn:stdo:product-definition:qualification-release-deployment\"\n      ],\n      \"authority\": [\n        \"./specification/PRODUCT.md#construction-authority\"\n      ],\n      \"uri\": \"./TASK.md\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"ticketing\": {\n    \"comments\": {\n      \"root\": \"./.ai-workspace/comments/\"\n    },\n    \"goals\": \"./specification/GOALS.md\",\n    \"sprints\": {\n      \"root\": \"./.ai-workspace/sprints/\"\n    },\n    \"tickets\": {\n      \"lanes\": {\n        \"active\": \"./.ai-workspace/tickets/active/\",\n        \"backlog\": \"./.ai-workspace/tickets/backlog/\",\n        \"completed\": \"./.ai-workspace/tickets/completed/\"\n      },\n      \"root\": \"./.ai-workspace/tickets/\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"what\": {\n    \"intent\": \"./specification/INTENT.md\",\n    \"product\": \"./specification/PRODUCT.md\",\n    \"specification\": [\n      \"./specification/REQUIREMENT.md\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n\n--- specification/REQUIREMENT.md ---\n# R1\nDeploy the selected exact retained release into deploy-test: payload.txt and manifest.json must equal retained/release byte for byte. Preserve deploy-test/unrelated.txt, unrelated/sentinel.txt and all source/configuration. Verify installed identity and write outputs/deployment.md with actual evidence and limits. Do not rename the selected release, publish remotely, or create another final cut.\n\n--- design/DESIGN.md ---\n# D1\nReacquire retained/SOURCE.json and the actual selected payload/manifest. Confirm all recorded identities and release_id. Use the native Writer separately for the two exact target files and the report, with current target observations. Check actual installed bytes against the retained manifest and source; installation availability and author verification do not imply owner acceptance or remote publication.\n\n--- TASK.md ---\n# Separately authorized exact local deployment\nFollowing actual release preparation, Root selects this distinct local deployment activation. The owner authorizes replacing only deploy-test/payload.txt and deploy-test/manifest.json from the exact retained release and writing outputs/deployment.md. This deployment grant applies only when Root selects its prepared preflight. Preserve unrelated content, prior candidate and identity. No remote publication, Git mutation, global configuration, new actor or further stage.\n\n--- TOOLING.md ---\n# Local tool binding\n\nNative 3.0.1 a_c is available as configured stdo_ac MCP tools, or this exact CLI (full request envelope on stdin):\n\n```sh\n/opt/homebrew/Cellar/python@3.13/3.13.7/Frameworks/Python.framework/Versions/3.13/bin/python3.13 -B /Users/jim/src/apps/specification_methodology-skills/a_c/build_tenants/graphify/code/ac_support.py --policy /private/var/folders/rz/r6wxvr0n15d906k2s0jw8j2h0000gn/T/stdo-skills-deployment-vup0_dwe/codex/control/worker-policy.json --policy-sha256 28f813256f7ec1fe45761de15364df01e52f5ad8f38e32048e580c92e5316463 --principal host call --request -\n```\n\nUse tools.describe for the exact contract. Scope grant: `urn:stdo-skills:qualification:codex:release-deploy:write`. Input source alias is `product`. Observe the output parent separately immediately before work.write; preserve target preimages and actual responses. Directory creation is permitted only within outputs. Stable governing inputs belong to Context; intended output preimages are separate. No native results.conjoin operator is selected.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
